# 11. Why this matters economically

Without scratch memory, every invocation does:

```text
retrieve 441 opportunities
↓
read them
↓
reason from zero
↓
reach basically same conclusions
```

Wasteful.

With scratch:

```text
retrieve changed/new opportunities
+
read last review
↓
update previous beliefs
```

Much cheaper.

So the Oracle API should eventually support:

```text
GET /opportunities/changes?since=<snapshot>
```

rather than always:

```text
GET /opportunities
```

Then:

```text
previous scratch
+
delta
=
new review
```

This is essentially event sourcing applied to the agent's attention.

